{
  "name": "Writer-Judge Loop",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f-task",
              "name": "task",
              "value": "Explain what a vector database is to a first-year engineering student in about 100 words.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-draft",
              "name": "draft",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-feedback",
              "name": "feedback",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Writer Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Task: {{ $json.task }}\n{{ $json.feedback\n  ? \"Your previous draft:\\n\" + $json.draft\n    + \"\\n\\nJudge feedback: \" + $json.feedback\n    + \"\\n\\nRewrite the draft to fix the feedback.\"\n  : \"Write the first draft.\" }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a Writer agent. Output only the final text, no preamble."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Groq Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGroq",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama-3.1-8b-instant",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "groqApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Groq account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Judge Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Task given to the writer: {{ $('Task').first().json.task }}\n\nDraft to evaluate:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nScore each criterion from 1 to 10:\n- accuracy: the facts are correct\n- clarity: a first-year student can follow it\n- conciseness: about 100 words, no filler\n\nReturn ONLY this JSON:\n{\"accuracy\": 0, \"clarity\": 0, \"conciseness\": 0,\n \"feedback\": \"one specific sentence on what to improve\"}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a strict evaluator. Reply with JSON only, no markdown."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "OpenRouter Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "google/gemma-3-27b-it:free",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openRouterApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "OpenRouter account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Parse Judge",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.text;\nlet j;\ntry {\n  j = JSON.parse(raw.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]);\n} catch (e) {\n  j = { accuracy: 0, clarity: 0, conciseness: 0,\n        feedback: \"Judge returned invalid JSON\" };\n}\n\nconst score = Math.round(\n  (Number(j.accuracy) + Number(j.clarity) + Number(j.conciseness)) / 3 * 10) / 10;\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  task: $('Task').first().json.task,\n  draft: $('Writer Agent').first().json.text,\n  feedback: j.feedback,\n  score: score,\n  attempt: $runIndex + 1\n}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Pass?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-pass",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.score >= 8 || $json.attempt >= 3 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Final Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1580,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r-text",
              "name": "final_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.draft }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "r-score",
              "name": "judge_score",
              "value": "={{ $json.score }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "r-att",
              "name": "attempts",
              "value": "={{ $json.attempt }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0010-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 380,
        "height": 160,
        "content": "## Circuit breaker\n`attempt >= 3` stops runaway loops. Without it a harsh judge can loop forever and burn API quota.\n\nFalse branch → back into **Writer Agent** with the judge's feedback."
      }
    }
  ],
